WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.9 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Accountability: participation, feedback and complaints

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Accountability means the people you serve can shape your work and raise concerns.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Offer several channels that suit different people.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Include one route outside the delivery team.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Close the loop: say what changed.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Talking circle after planting days, a school feedback box, and Ibu Made for sensitive concerns.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your feedback channels and how you close the loop.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
